  "question": {
    "text": "The contrapositive of the statement &quot;I go to school if it does not rain&quot; is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "If it rains, I go to school.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "If it rains, I do not go to school.",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "If I go to school, it rains.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "If I do not go to school, it rains.",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;It does not rain</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;I go to school</p><p>Contrapositive of if <math> <mrow> <mi>p</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mover> <mo>&#8594;</mo> <mrow></mrow> </mover> <mi>q</mi> </mrow> </math> is if <math> <mrow> <mo>&#8764;</mo><mi>q</mi><mover> <mo>&#8594;</mo> <mrow></mrow> </mover> <mo>&#8764;</mo><mi>p</mi> </mrow> </math></p><p>So, If it rains, I do not go to school.</p>"
  }
